      {
        "id": 228216,
        "name": "bolnerap",
        "username": "bolnerap",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bolnerap/{size}/6056_2.png",
        "created_at": "2019-07-25T03:21:55.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Four-round stomping on my end. I got out Wraith's Eyepiece turn 1 and started deck stacking with either her or Benchmark every turn, such that Kismet never got to play a Lucky card. Meanwhile, Bunker got a couple bots out for Unity, and a Flash Forge netted two Raptors and a Construction Pylon. The Raptor army and a couple of boosted Razor Ordnances&nbsp;made short work of Kismet while Benchmark soaked every Jinx that came out. Final HP 26 / 15 / 27 / 22.</p>",
